      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. some of the residents are getting pretty worked up about how this will ruin the \"feel\" of the neighborhood and change the community character though. i feel like they're just being obstructionist, but i want to be prepared. how should i frame their concerns so they don't derail the whole meeting?",
